+# Changes, round 1
+
+Addresses the two groups of held-out failures quoted in REVIEW.md. Checklist items 1-8 were already satisfied and remain so.
+
+## src/layer.mjs
+
+- `undefined` in `over` now counts as not given, at any depth: `merge` skips any key whose value in `over` is `undefined`, so base's value (copied) is kept, and a key only `over` has with `undefined` does not appear. Fixes the four "undefined" cases.
+- Non-plain data now throws a `TypeError`: `copy` no longer uses `structuredClone` or returns functions as is. Functions, Maps, Sets, class instances (and any other non-plain object) throw, at any depth, inside arrays, and in either `base` or `over`. `Date`s are still allowed and are copied with `new Date(getTime())`. Fixes the seven "not plain data" cases.
+
+## tests/layer.test.mjs
+
+- New tests: undefined handling (all four review cases plus a nested added key), TypeError for function/Map/Set/class instance (top level, deep, inside arrays, in base and in over, and replacing a base value), and Date allowed and copied.
+
+## CHANGELOG.md
+
+- The `layer` line now mentions the `undefined` rule and the TypeError for non-plain data.
